\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3.** We find the vector ${v}_{3}$ orthogonal to $\\text{Span}{{v}_{1},{v}_{2}}$ using the usual formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{v}_{3} & ={a}_{3}-{\\text{proj}}_{{v}_{1}}\\,{a}_{3}-{\\text{proj}}_{{v}_{2}}\\,{a}_{3} \\\\  & ={a}_{3}-\\frac{{a}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{1}}{{v}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}}{v}_{1}-\\frac{{a}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{2}}{{v}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}}{v}_{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]-\\frac{11}{11}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]-\\frac{7}{7}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\n\\frac{a}{c}=\\frac{3}{1}=3.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-140895/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9870ad37-3e54-5403-936c-09a321d4a0cf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140895"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-95862/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "17dfe200-0606-556e-a46b-c6cd57d2bc15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95862/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "c567b78e-669b-5fce-af49-b06c9283c34e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95862/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "47a516cf-2fcc-5c4a-ba85-02a6e795db83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95862/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d3cf30